1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,179
And two boys: Hongr, the narrator's nephew, and Shuisheng, Runtu's son, the image of young Runtu without the necklet.

2
00:00:09,179 --> 00:00:13,528
They become friends at once, exactly as their elders once did.

3
00:00:13,528 --> 00:00:22,617
When the mother asks Runtu to call her son brother, as he used to, Runtu refuses: he was a child then and did not understand.

